                              <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Builds the per-account run summary for the email body. Summary!D20, D27 and D30 are Excel formulas with no cached value, so nothing can read Check_Balance back from the workbook - it is recomputed here from D16, D23 and the DR/CR columns of the two outstanding sheets, which is the same arithmetic the sheet performs." DisplayName="Build run summary" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="513,600" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_500">
